   "n_markup": 40,
   "text": "    <sec id=\"s1\">\n      <title>Introduction</title>\n      <p>Shorebirds that feed on mudflats can only reach their prey when the tide is out. Earlier work on dunlin (<italic>Calidris alpina</italic>) suggested that they also prefer daylight, but most studies were too short to separate the two effects <xref ref-type=\"bibr\" rid=\"r1\">[1]</xref>.</p>\n"
  },
