   "n_markup": 32,
   "text": "    <sec id=\"s2\">\n      <title>Methods</title>\n      <p>We tagged 46 adult dunlin with 1.2 g GPS loggers between March and May 2025. Loggers recorded a position every 10 minutes for up to 9 weeks.</p>\n      <p>Tide heights came from the Port Avelin harbour gauge. A position on the exposed mudflat counted as foraging.</p>\n"
  },
