   "n_markup": 22,
   "text": "    <sec id=\"s3\">\n      <title>Results</title>\n      <p>Birds spent 71 percent of all low-tide hours foraging, compared with 9 percent of high-tide hours. Foraging at night was as common as during the day when the tide was low.</p>\n"
  },
